  "label": "situational irony",
  "description": "A literary device where the outcome of a situation is contrary to what is expected. The meme uses situational irony by depicting a woman lounging casually in a shopping cart while dealing with a broken appliance, which is an absurd and humorous contrast to the seriousness of the situation.",
